  "_comment": "DinosaurApp (kids shell) screenshot capture: 11 distinct real-use activity states (How big? slider with different dinosaurs and references, partly-brushed fossil digs, Shadow match boards, dinosaur cards), each a different dinosaur / seed and a cycled theme (sand / fern / volcano). No home menu, sticker book, parent area, gate or reveal popup in any slot. _setup_taps unlocks full_pack (every dinosaur reachable, no banner), mutes the voice for capture and seeds some met dinosaurs. Screens are opened with KIDS.go(screen, params); dig/match seeds fix the round.",
